      "widgets_values": [
        "A person from a photo speaks your script in real time with LTX. Queue it and the first take plays in the Reactor Realtime window. Write the next script there and press Apply; it plays as the next take once the one before ends. Press Done to save the takes under reactor/realtime.\n\nThe photo sets who speaks. The scene, read at the start, casts the voice and the delivery. Pace is words per minute.\n\nLTX prompt guide: https://docs.reactor.inc/model-api-reference/ltx/prompt-guide\n\nSet your Reactor API key in this plugin's config.ini."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
